   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;line-break:after-white-space\">Hello Vincent,<div><br></div><div>Not sure if I have found an error — Could you please confirm the naming of the variables related to non wear_perc as listed (from the vignette webpage):<br><div><br></div><div><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/RpackageGGIR/attach/daf5e9e785966/PastedGraphic-5.png?part=0.1.1&amp;view=1\"><br><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>For example, I would have thought that nonwear_perc_day was the non wear percentage during <i>only</i> the day, and the non wear_perc_day_spt is the non wear percentage during the <i>whole</i><span style=\"font-style:normal\"> day (sleep + day)? </span></div><div><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-style:normal\">I compare the above to the naming convention below, which makes more sense to me and used elsewhere that _day = wake, _spt = sleep, and _day_spt = whole day?</span> </div><div><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><br></span></div><div><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/RpackageGGIR/attach/daf5e9e785966/PastedGraphic-6.png?part=0.1.2&amp;view=1\"></div><div><br></div><div>Thanks,</div><div><br></div><div>Graydon</div><div>\r\n<div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;word-wrap:break-word;line-break:after-white-space\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;word-wrap:break-word;line-break:after-white-space\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;word-wrap:break-word;line-break:after-white-space\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;word-wrap:break-word;line-break:after-white-space\"><br>Graydon Raymer R.Kin, PhD</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;word-wrap:break-word;line-break:after-white-space\">Director, School of Physical and Health Education<br>Room 201F, Centre for Physical and Health Education</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;word-wrap:break-word;line-break:after-white-space\">Nipissing University<br>100 College Drive, Box 5002<br>North Bay, Ontario P1B 8L7<br>Canada<br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;word-wrap:break-word;line-break:after-white-space\"><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">Email: gray...@nipissingu.ca</a></div></div></div></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<br></div></div></div>"
