   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div>Thanks, well spotted. The documentation indeed needs to be reversed. &quot;day_spt&quot; is whole day, while &quot;day&quot; on its own is only waking hours.<br></div><div><br></div><div>Best, Vincent</div><div><br></div><div><div><div><div><br></div></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(107,107,107)\">Dr. Vincent van Hees</span><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(107,107,107)\">Independent consultant</span><br></div><div><a title=\"https://accelting.com/\" href=\"https://accelting.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://accelting.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792490598353000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0A-tTohwKhWHt3tZDRR5yF\">https://accelting.com/</a><br></div><div><div><br></div></div><div><div><a href=\"https://accelting.com/\" title=\"https://accelting.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://accelting.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792490598353000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0A-tTohwKhWHt3tZDRR5yF\"><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/RpackageGGIR/attach/db2be79fa9cd2/ACCELTING.png?part=0.1.3&amp;view=1\" alt=\"ACCELTING.png\"></a><br></div></div><div><br></div></div><div><br></div></div><div><br></div><div>‐‐‐‐‐‐‐ Original Message ‐‐‐‐‐‐‐<br></div>"
